  "role": "Entrance-seeded diagnostic clips, not continuous POWER-ON/dashboard/pixel proof. Complete clip input after one initial snapshot; no later state correction.",
  "sourceRules": [
    "DoFootCheck treats nonzero pipe metatiles1C..20 as terrain: land when the foot depth is below5, otherwise ImpedePlayerMove. Excluding them lost both landing and one-pixel foot pushes.",
    "SideCheckLoop skips1C/6B only at the upper body probe. The lower probe can impede on1C.",
    "CheckSideMTiles starts a side pipe from1F/6C only for Player_State0 and PlayerFacingDir1; use existing native horizontal motor facing, not the mirrored p.facing input direction.",
    "Actual source contact replaces fitted geometric entryTriggerX only where the pipe has native metatiles."
